  same on Metal3, 1000 um x 10 um                      R =   9.0 ohm, I = 0.610 mA -> IR drop 5.49 mV; current density 0.061 mA/um (limit 2.09 mA/um at 85 C, 1.0 at 110 C for Metal1-4; 4.5 for the top metal: ORGANIZER table)
  per-channel branch, Metal3 300 um x 2 um (0.085 mA)  R =  13.5 ohm, I = 0.085 mA -> IR drop 1.15 mV; current density 0.043 mA/um (limit 2.09 mA/um at 85 C, 1.0 at 110 C for Metal1-4; 4.5 for the top metal: ORGANIZER table)
